{"step_index":722,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:46:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T20:46:56-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T20:46:56-05:00\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/<user>/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c/gta6_mission_flow_chart.md`\nTotal Lines: 401\nTotal Bytes: 27080\nShowing lines 1 to 100\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: # Grand Theft Auto VI: Campaign Mission Flow & Prerequisite Guide\n2: \n3: This document provides the definitive mission dependency graph, prerequisite unlock trees, character-switching milestones, heist setup pipelines, points of no return, and speedrun routing across all 5 story chapters of *Grand Theft Auto VI*.\n4: \n5: ---\n6: \n7: ## 1. High-Level Campaign Architecture\n8: \n9: The GTA VI storyline progresses through five distinct geographical and thematic narrative blocks. While open-world exploration is available between operations, missions operate in a strict Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) with key narrative bottlenecks connecting each chapter.\n10: \n11: ```mermaid\n12: flowchart TD\n13:     subgraph C1B[\"Prologue & Chapter 1\"]\n14:         C1[\"Just Like Paradise<br/>(Leonida Keys & Key Lento)<br/>Missions 1 - 18\"]\n15:     end\n16: \n17:     subgraph C2B[\"Chapter 2\"]\n18:         C2[\"Paradise Lost<br/>(Port Gellhorn & Kelly County)<br/>Missions 23 - 44\"]\n19:     end\n20: \n21:     subgraph C3B[\"Chapter 3\"]\n22:         C3[\"Vice City Syndicate Expansion<br/>(Vice City Metro & Sinfrontera Heist)<br/>Missions 45 - 70\"]\n23:     end\n24: \n25:     subgraph C4B[\"Chapter 4\"]\n26:         C4[\"Vice City Metro & Airport Takedown<br/>(Ocean Beach & VCIA Cargo Heist)<br/>Missions 71 - 95\"]\n27:     end\n28: \n29:     subgraph C5B[\"Chapter 5\"]\n30:         C5[\"Top of the World, Ma!<br/>(Climax, Standoff & Branching Endings)<br/>Missions 96 - 102\"]\n31:     end\n32: \n33:     C1 -->|\"Bottleneck: Doin' Gone\"| C2\n34:     C2 -->|\"Bottleneck: Check\n<truncated 2435 bytes>\ntion<br/>(Cal Hamlet Trip - $200 Mailbox)\"] --> M07[\"7. Pipework<br/>(Marina Maintenance Jobs)\"]\n64:     end\n65:     \n66:     subgraph Track2[\"Branch 2: Brian Armory & Gate\"]\n67:         M03[\"3. Gear Up<br/>(Longarm Pickup)\"] --> M04[\"4. Just a Scratch<br/>(Ganado Respray - MANDATORY GATE)\"]\n68:     end\n69:     \n70:     subgraph Track3[\"Branch 3: Main Narrative Spine\"]\n71:         M05[\"5. Lab Fees<br/>(Rent Collection)\"] --> M08[\"8. Hey Arnold!<br/>(Cargo Broker Recon)\"]\n72:         M08 -.-> M09[\"9. Island Dreams<br/>(Optional Keys Diving)\"]\n73:         M08 --> M10[\"10. Feng Shui<br/>(Move Furniture - 24h Cooldown)\"]\n74:         M10 --> M11[\"11. Coming Home<br/>★ LUCIA RELEASED FROM PRISON ★\"]\n75:         M11 --> M12[\"12. Find Donnie's Package<br/>(Hamlet Retrieval)\"]\n76:     end\n77:     \n78:     B1_Split --> M06\n79:     B1_Split --> M03\n80:     B1_Split --> M05\n81:     \n82:     %% Decision Diamond 1\n83:     M12 --> DIA1{\"Did player finish<br/>JUST A SCRATCH?\"}\n84:     DIA1 -->|\"NO\"| JOEY[\"Joey Reminder Call<br/>(Redirects to Just a Scratch)\"]\n85:     JOEY -.-> M04\n86:     M04 -.-> DIA1\n87:     \n88:     DIA1 -->|\"YES\"| M13[\"13. Buck Me<br/>(Banking App Setup & Deposit)\"]\n89:     M13 --> M14[\"14. Down to Earth<br/>(Marina Smuggling Run - $600 Mailbox)\"]\n90:     M14 --> M15[\"15. Clear Skies<br/>(Southwind Bikers)\"]\n91:     M15 --> M16[\"16. Day Release<br/>(Rusty Anchor Bar Night Out)\"]\n92:     \n93:     %% Decision Diamond 2\n94:     M16 --> DIA2{\"Are DAY RELEASE &<br/>JUST A SCRATCH both done?\"}\n95:     M04 ==>|\"Mandatory Check\"| DIA2\n96:     \n97:     DIA2 -->|\"YES\"| M17[\"17. Swamped<br/>(Kingfishers Smugglers Meet)\"]\n98:     M17 --> M18[\"