{"step_index":779,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-25T01:53:21Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-24T20:53:21-05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-24T20:53:21-05:00\n\nThe command exited with code 0.\nOutput:\nTitles count in table_0019be000: 36888\r\n0001768b: Hey Lucia! We gettin to the money eh? I'll take more of them doubloons for sure. Bring it down to my shop and I'll take a look! Oh and keep an eye out for pieces of meteorite too. They're all over. I'll buy what u find. There's people on Lifeinvader Marketplace pay GOOD money for them. Supposed to boost ur vitality. Probably bullshit but the $$$ is real, yuh know?\r\n000264b4: Blood Smith\r\n0002c0ad: You'll live.\r\n00052e3a: @VCFIREDEPT\r\n00061c8d: Cycle Weather\r\n000b10b3: Lorena Caminos\r\n000bc873: Jason\r\n000c7c1d: Stunts\r\n000da605: You're not an easy woman to find, Lucia! Luckily I still have some connections at Lifeinvader that let me use their friend finder facial tracking tech! The AudaCity team was so impressed by your aptitude and willingness to engage with risk at the founder presale bike jump, we wanted to invite you into the blockchain revolution. Will you join us?\r\n000f1bce: The Tunnel\r\n00106a31: @just2jones\r\n001094f9: Swimwear\r\n0010a4f9: 66~n~~n~He takes you in his burly arms, his hot sausage supper breath caressing your skin. Your knees grow weak as he speaks in his soft accent, \"Lass, gi us a wee sook and I'll gi ye a chib wi ma stauner.\" Do you permit him to chib you with his stauner?~n~~n~If yes, turn to 89. If no, turn to 101.\r\n0013cece: You won't receive pending BuckMe ~BLIP_APP_PAYMENT~ transactions until there's room in your account.\r\n00145f5c: You received a cash payment from Donnie.\r\n0018a952: Climbing the Cellerichain\r\n001a3010: @kittyglitterqueen\r\n001a53f0: @CaTkaRaTe\r\n001a61f6: Turbo\r\n001ac4d5: Well the shows over so there goes our chance. Thanks for nothin, neighbor.\r\n001ad01c: Del Rio Blvd\r\n001c489c: Left some groceries for you. Check outside.\r\n001c58cf: @Johnston_Calamity\r\n00204667: Host\r\n00210eaf: Yeah, would be good to draw a line under this before the hard drive auction for sure.\r\n\n"}
